===== scaffold brief: t-gerrit =====
25:1. Never push with git and never create a change except through the one `gerrit-axi publish --squash` your Definition of done names. Never run `gerrit-axi submit`, never vote or review a change by any path, including `gerrit review` or a label option on a push, and never abandon one: a human reviewer approves and submits it on the server.

